2pt\">-MAIL</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> ( yjoh83@kumoh.ac.kr ) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 오름관 : 팩스번호 ( 054-478-7943 )</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;E</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-MAIL</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> ( cko4987@kumoh.ac.kr ) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">E</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-MAIL 신청시 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">제목 &nbsp;“신입생 환불 신청” 으로 표시 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 환불신청 후 반드시 확인 전화 바라며, 환불 이후 절대 변경할 수 없음을 알려드립니다.&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 학생회비(10,000원)를 납부한 경우, 생활관비와 별도로 입금됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 환불 시기&nbsp;&nbsp;＊&nbsp; 9시 ~ 13시 접수분 : 당일 내 환불</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;＊ 13시 ~ 18시 접수분 : 신청서 접수 다음 날 환불 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 신청서 접수 확인 및 문의사항 연락처</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">푸름관(☎ 054-478-7203/7270), 오름관(☎ 054-478-7942/7940)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
